{"id":"n83571-1-7","stage":5,"title":"푸대접 · 怠慢","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83571-1-7-1","ko":"뭐 이런 식당이 다 있어?","zh":"怎么会有一家这样的餐厅啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"이런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89753","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당이","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"连","explanation":"다：连","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"3","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"89753","definition":"看到或者听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"连","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"表示“出乎意料地”，含有轻微惊讶、感叹、嘲讽等意思。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f046cab54cb65d7f9d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83571-1-7-2","ko":"그러게 말이야. 이렇게 손님에게 푸대접을 하는 곳도 드물 거야.","zh":"就是啊。这么怠慢顾客的地方应该也很少见吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"真是的，不像话","explanation":"말：真是的，不像话；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"9","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님에게","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"푸대접을","meaning":"怠慢，冷落 ，亏待，冷遇","explanation":"푸대접：怠慢，冷落 ，亏待，冷遇；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"푸대접","audio":"/audio/7fe8f46657006f9f9ece.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83571","senseId":"1","lemma":"푸대접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做出，作出","explanation":"하다：做出，作出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳도","meaning":"处，个","explanation":"곳：处，个；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"3","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드물","meaning":"少有，罕见","explanation":"드물다：少有，罕见；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"드물다","audio":"/audio/a752d73161eca834e93a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15040","senseId":"2","lemma":"드물다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"真是的，不像话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"对某种行为未能实现表示慨叹。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"7fe8f46657006f9f","term":"푸대접","zh":"怠慢，冷落 ，亏待，冷遇","audio":"/audio/7fe8f46657006f9f9ece.mp3","entryId":"83571","definition":"不尽心，随意招待。","pronunciation":["푸대접"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做出，作出","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"露出某种表情或表现出某种态度等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"处，个","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"计算地点或位置的数量单位。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"a752d73161eca834","term":"드물다","zh":"少有，罕见","audio":"/audio/a752d73161eca834e93a.mp3","entryId":"15040","definition":"不多见。","pronunciation":["드물다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/86d0370239a181266f6d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.214,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83571","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0407,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是啊。这么怠慢顾客的地方应该也很少见吧。","怎么会有一家这样的餐厅啊？","承奎，假期的日程都安排好了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么会有一家这样的餐厅啊？","承奎，假期的日程都安排好了吗？","就是啊。这么怠慢顾客的地方应该也很少见吧。"],"answer":2}]}
